 "notes": [
  "Pual yiqtol Eccl.9.4 (יבחר, ketiv, unvocalized) was invisible before the pipeline's ketiv-extraction fix -- included per confirmation, but flagged as the lowest-confidence addition in this batch. Its qere, יְחֻבַּר (H2266 חבר \"join\"), is a one-letter consonant metathesis of the ketiv (בחר/חבר) and is the near-universal traditional reading (\"whoever is joined to all the living has hope\"); the ketiv's \"whoever is chosen among all the living\" is a substantially less common construal. Kept as a genuinely distinct Strong's number per the fix's rule, but this is a textual-variant judgment call more than the other additions in this batch."
 ],
